<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian internal security forces arrested former regime officer Ahmad Raslan and a former general accused of the 2014 Ghouta ambush. Two young men were killed by a landmine explosion and another young man died in a war-remnant blast while herding livestock in the Aleppo countryside. Syrian Airlines announced direct flights from Damascus and Aleppo to Cairo. Over 23,000 children have been killed during the civil war, and there were 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTE9sMTBaMXc3dHA5Ymo5bTNNMnFmeXY0U1AxZmZseENxS3V2OFMzLU5MMkdpci1IMnRYX0NOclNUWk9lWjN1WjhzSUpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPbVY0NnNsRjJLR2s0TzdfLTBSMDl1UHRmQXdPSkc5RkxyNTJkMDBrM1NrRTRWUUx3UlZIVjRYNlZ5VHVRZ0dnNk9mZVhqM3E4WDZrNkVnZEYyVlJZUDQtZ2R2YWJVTFM4MWxDd210R0FLMUpiVGFuNTJmX2pPM3Q4MXpnZ2RRWWtZOXM2c1VrUHRmVkVfT1ZuSkhKamc3VlRlQW5rOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPcUVjNXZnS19aQmVkMi1TcDlMNUlTUHRPWHNpRkVOLVp2R0xqR3ZHSWpGcVRZWW5haC1NWjNaaldrcHNvNFFfaFNLYXlkZDJJRGZjQ2FtenBqbWhmbXZCaXFxSFFUVndwbDkxWVhoSC1fN0lySjUwaVpVZExqa2NtTG56TzNOUkN6Ti16NnF0TkVoZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBMY3pWN2x5NzFVMXAteWRRVzlJaXNEcGg1VUY5ejE3aDNmQ05MMFJNY0hHNm1NbUxncTMzT3p6dVBadmlVcVUyaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxORkNGUk9IU0xCOEZNeFdxdWZtU0ZvYUNfR1FtdlV5Tnh3NEMzeE5Xb0RzOHp3RS1UanhFTFEzSmtyMFJ0dXlZa2RrUzdLSWN1cDJhNGswN1VxYVhQSEwtMTZ2Q3hZcGNZd0JTbjhma0FqVWpqUmV1WXBMeXA2SkRqaTA5cGZrTzV4WklJYnE2RXM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sada